or-element elementor-element-05bdaae elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"05bdaae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n						<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n				<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-phone\"></i>				</span>\n			</div>\n			\n						<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n									<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n						<span  >\n							Contact &amp; Requirement						</span>\n					</h5>\n				\n									<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n						Call or submit your enquiry. Our engineers assess your cooling or power requirements and recommend the right equipment for your site.					</p>\n				\n			</div>\n			\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba0843d elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"ba0843d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n						<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n				<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-file-contract\"></i>				</span>\n			</div>\n			\n						<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n									<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n						<span  >\n							Quotation &amp; Agreement						</span>\n					</h5>\n				\n									<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n						We provide a fast, transparent quote with flexible rental terms - daily, weekly, or monthly - and finalise the agreement to suit your timeline.					</p>\n				\n			</div>\n			\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c23e656 elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-view-default elementor-position-block-start elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"c23e656\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n						<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n				<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n				<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-tools\"></i>				</span>\n			</div>\n			\n						<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n									<h5 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n						<span  >\n							Delivery &amp; Installation						</span>\n					</h5>\n				\n									<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n						Our team delivers, installs, and commissions the equipment on-site across the UAE - with 24/7 technical support throughout your rental period.					</p>\n				\n			</div>\n			\n		</div>\n						</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0639cd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e0639cd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1342409 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1342409\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfe45de elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cfe45de\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p>Call us now: +971 50 369 2131   &#8