     \"name\": \"HVACLINIC\",\n            \"url\": \"https://hvaclinic.com/\",\n            \"logo\": {\n                \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n                \"inLanguage\": \"en-US\",\n                \"@id\": \"https://hvaclinic.com/#/schema/logo/image/\",\n                \"url\": \"https://hvaclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/hvac.gif\",\n                \"contentUrl\": \"https://hvaclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/hvac.gif\",\n                \"width\": 340,\n                \"height\": 107,\n                \"caption\": \"HVACLINIC\"\n            },\n            \"image\": {\n                \"@id\": \"https://hvaclinic.com/#/schema/logo/image/\"\n            }\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(114,9,'About – Rental Chiller','about','		<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"623\" class=\"elementor elementor-623\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0aa070e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0aa070e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84f59a5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"84f59a5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n					</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-167b9a7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"167b9a7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n					<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ff44c8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ff44c8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-83dea25 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"83dea25\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n															<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"726\" height=\"704\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/g-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2211\" alt=\"rental cooling dubai\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/g-2.jpg 726w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/03/g-2-300x291.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 726px) 100vw, 726px\" />															</div>\n				</div>\n				</div>\n		<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d9d0de6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d9d0de6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9f02a38 elementor-widget-tablet__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9f02a38\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n					<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About HVAC Clinic</h2>				</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a34f8ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a34f8ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n									<p>At <strong data-start=\"184\" data-end=\"199\">HVAC Clinic</strong>, our vision is to become the <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"307\">most trusted and innovative HVAC and cooling solutions provider in the UAE</strong>. We strive to empower businesses and individuals with <strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"430\">reliable, efficient, and sustainable cooling and power solutions</strong>, including <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"579\">rental generators, rental chillers, rental ACs, temporary cooling systems, chiller maintenance, and high-quality refurbished chillers</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"584\" data-end=\"987\">We are committed to <strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"657\">excellence, innovation, and customer satisfaction</strong>, ensuring that every solution we provide enhances comfort, efficiency, and operational reliability. Through cutting-edge technology, professional expertise, and a client-focused approach, we aim to <strong data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"909\">set the industry standard for quality and service</strong>, helping our clients achieve their goals with confidence and peace of mind.</p>								</div>\n				</div>\n				<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-011b7c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion\" data-id=\"011b7c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"accordion.default\">\n				<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion\">\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-1161\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1161\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n													<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n															<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n								<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n														</span>\n												<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">We specialize in:</a>\n					</div>\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1161\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1161\"><ul><li data-section-id=\"1arq3mx\" data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"808\"><strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"763\">Rental Generators</strong> &#8211; Reliable power solutions for all scales.</li><li data-section-id=\"brkvv6\" data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"906\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"836\">Rental Chillers &amp; ACs</strong> &#8211; Flexible cooling solutions for events, projects, and emergencies.</li><li data-section-id=\"1nco4an\" data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"1002\"><strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"937\">Rental Cooling Equipment</strong> &#8211; Optimized temporary cooling for industries and large spaces.</li><li data-section-id=\"1b4171h\" data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1118\"><strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1028\">Chiller Maintenance</strong> &#8211; Expert servicing and preventive maintenance to keep your systems running efficiently.</li><li data-section-id=\"sbghk1\" data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1230\"><strong data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1152\">Used &amp; Refurbished Chillers</strong> &#8211; High-quality, cost-effective chiller solutions for long-term reliability.</li></ul></div>\n				</div>\n							<div class=\"elementor-accordion-item\">\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-title-1162\" class=\"elementor-tab-title\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"button\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1162\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n													<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n															<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-closed\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span>\n								<span class=\"elementor-accordion-icon-opened\"><i class=\"fas fa-minus\"></i></span>\n														</span>\n												<a class=\"elementor-accordion-title\" tabindex=\"0\">Our Vision</a>\n					</div>\n					<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1162\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-1162\"><p>To be the <strong data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"235\">leading provider of innovative, reliable, and sustainable HVAC solutions</strong> in the UAE, empowering our clients with efficient cooling, power, and maintenance services. We aim to set the standard in <strong data-start=